			<attribute key="id" type="int">14</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some common mistakes.
1. Not putting a space or putting multiple spaces (e.g. between Hello and Kiran)
2. Not using capital H in Hello or capital Y in You
3. Not putting a full stop in the second line
4. Printing output in a single line
</attribute>
